+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 defineProps resolves a generic alias or interface given as a literal, an intersection, an alias of an alias, an interface and an import (packages/compiler-sfc/__tests__/compileScript/resolveType.spec.ts) [AC-1] [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Bind a generic's type parameters to the reference's arguments, and resolve them in the scope of its members (packages/compiler-sfc/src/script/resolveType.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Record a type alias with type parameters as its declaration, so that its parameters stay readable (packages/compiler-sfc/src/script/resolveType.ts)
